        "created_at": "2015-03-22T15:51:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I realize this is only tangentially related, but decades ago I played a game in which one is defending an island from attackers. It is expected that the defenders will lose the island. The game is scored based on how long one can keep from losing the island.</p>",
