        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-22T16:32:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Battletech had lopsided battles, but the scoring was such that people preferred the underdogs, because they could win so much and would lose so little, but trying to win with the advantage, but with as few resources lost as possible was hard, and you could lose so badly if things went horribly wrong.</p>",
