      {
        "id": 137601,
        "name": "LeperKhan",
        "username": "LeperKhan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/leperkhan/{size}/1894_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-30T21:38:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll just chime in here to say I'm glad to see so many 'Playtester' banners present in this thread because it means that it's at least on people's minds as you work through the Broken City &amp; For Profit stuff. I can't get my gaming group to play the scenarios anymore...we finished on Dawn's first one (naturally). As others have stated, it simply wasn't fun. We stick with the skirmishes now, but I actually want to get back to the story of it all, and oddly, I actually like being told exactly which tile goes where and the little extra rules for things. Seems too little, too late for the original stuff, but here's hoping the expansions can still tell a decent story while having it equally fun for both sides.</p>",
