        "id": 137602,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-30T23:24:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe you'd like to give my <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/tactics/files/one-shot_scenarios.zip\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">One-Shot Scenarios</a> a try. &nbsp;They have the extra rules and setup instructions like you like, on a single page each for each one. &nbsp;Unfortunately, they're not fully balanced yet (I pulled many of them from the scenario books), but the more people who try them out and give feedback, the sooner we can get to a well balanced set of scenarios that are fun to play.</p>",
