      {
        "id": 137604,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-31T12:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"morph147\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> morph147:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>how would you play the 3rd baron blade scenario without playing the second?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You can play any of the scenarios stand alone. Just ignore the \"if X won, then Y\" conditions for setup.</p>\n<p>Blade would start with 0 turrets in play (so just choose the pylon positions carefully) but he would have access to all 4 turret types. That would seem to be a reasonable way to start.</p>\n<p>You may adjust that to your groups liking though.</p>",
